{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/OrbiTowerLogoHeaderMedium.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hungry Gooper swarm threatens intergalactic peace. Stop them! Build towers around planets and take control over their orbits. Spin them with all you\u2019ve attached! Collect new towers, powers and upgrades to beat the onslaught of goopers and save the galaxy in this colorful Tower Defense Roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_control_the_orbits.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/DrehenSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic defense is a good defense. Freely rotate orbits with all the towers you\u2019ve built on them. Reposition your defenses, take control of the battlefield, and spin your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_build_your_defenses.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/BauenSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build smart. Every encounter throws something new at you \u2014 so bring the right tools: turrets, bombs, and enough lasers to light up the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_assemble_your_arsenal.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/RewardSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are the same \u2014 build your arsenal as you go. Make it efficient, unpredictable, or just plain devastating. Synergy is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_unlock_it_all.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Unlock.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each run, unlock new possibilities - more towers, powers and characters, each with their own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_footer.png?t=1743012339\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555830?t=1743012339","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/df3da39d2c920e0f0bf3c25fcc06416ae93e377e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743012339","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/0cd29b555415455e749ccf775f53f69742b46537/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743012339","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/0cd29b555415455e749ccf775f53f69742b46537/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743012339","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/OrbiTowerLogoHeaderMedium.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The hungry Gooper swarm threatens intergalactic peace. Stop them! Build towers around planets and take control over their orbits. Spin them with all you\u2019ve attached! Collect new towers, powers and upgrades to beat the onslaught of goopers and save the galaxy in this colorful Tower Defense Roguelite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_control_the_orbits.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/DrehenSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic defense is a good defense. Freely rotate orbits with all the towers you\u2019ve built on them. Reposition your defenses, take control of the battlefield, and spin your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_build_your_defenses.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/BauenSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build smart. Every encounter throws something new at you \u2014 so bring the right tools: turrets, bombs, and enough lasers to light up the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_assemble_your_arsenal.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/RewardSmall.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No two runs are the same \u2014 build your arsenal as you go. Make it efficient, unpredictable, or just plain devastating. Synergy is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_unlock_it_all.png?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Unlock.gif?t=1743012339\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each run, unlock new possibilities - more towers, powers and characters, each with their own playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/extras/Steam_Page_footer.png?t=1743012339\" /></p>","developers":["Spicy Sushi Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555830/header.jpg?t=1743012339","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257101828,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101828/movie480.mp4?t=1743012336","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101828/movie_max.mp4?t=1743012336"},"name":"OrbiTower Alphatrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257101828/db6b581b05716edf8489c9e664c8b0660866de15/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743012336","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101828/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743012336","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257101828/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743012336"}}],"nam